return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-30T00:04:55+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-30T00:04:55+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Wani ma\'ajiyar shafi da kuma ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta Redis ga duk wani shafin WordPress. Yana amfani da ma\'ajiyar uwar garken LiteSpeed inda akwai da kuma tasa ma\'ajiyar ajiyar diski a duk sauran wurare, yana share abin da kawai sauyi ya shafa, kuma yana tabbatar da cewa haɗin Redis nasa yana aiki.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi','Page cache'=>'Taskar shafin','Object cache'=>'Ma\'ajiyar Abu','Purging'=>'Ana sharewa','Exclusions'=>'Banbance-banbance','Purge everything now'=>'Tsaftace komai yanzu','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'An cire kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi kuma za a sake gina su yayin da baƙi ke zuwa. Ka ci gaba?','Full-page cache'=>'Caching shafi gaba ɗaya','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'A kan sabar ta LiteSpeed, gidan yanar gizo yana ba da shafuka ta hanyar gidan yanar gizo kafin WordPress ya yi aiki. A kowane sabar daban, wannan plugin ɗin yana adana kowane shafi azaman fayil kuma yana ba da shi kafin WordPress ya lodawa. Wannan shine inda kusan duk saurin ya fito.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Ajiye shafuka a ma\'ajiyar ɗan lokaci ga baƙi waɗanda ba su shiga ba','How long a page stays cached'=>'Tsawon lokacin da shafi ke kasancewa a adana a cikin cache','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Daƙiƙa. Mako ɗaya ya dace da yawancin shafuka; gidan yanar gizon labarai da ke wallafawa a kowace awa yana buƙatar kaɗan sosai.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Tsawon lokacin da burauzar baƙo ke riƙe hotuna da rubutun shirin','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Daƙiƙa. Ana amfani da shi kawai ga hotuna, CSS da JavaScript — ba ga shafuka ba. Sanya zuwa 0 don barin wannan ga mai masaukin baki na ku.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Masu ziyara da suka shiga','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Kada ka taba ba da shafi da aka adana a madubi ga mai ziyara da ya shiga ciki','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'On shine amintaccen amsa kuma tsohuwar siga ta asali. Kashe shi kawai idan ka san cewa kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi iri ɗaya ne ga kowane mai amfani da ya shiga - rukunin membobi shine dalilin da ya saba sa ba a yin hakan.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Rayuwa daban-daban don abubuwa daban-daban','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Misali: shafukan samfur na wani shago na tsawon awa guda, yayin da komai zai kasance na tsawon mako guda.','Add a rule'=>'Sanya doka','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Seconds'=>'Dakiku','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Cache na abu (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Mai masaukin gidan ku yana gudanar da cache na abu na Redis mai zaman kansa don wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma yana kiyaye shi a daidaita. Babu abin da za a saita an nan; matsayi a saman wannan allon yana nuna ko yana aiki.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Yana adana sakamakon binciken bayanan rumbu. Yana taimakawa sosai a kan kantin da ke da aiki sosai ko kuma wani shafi mai yawan baƙi da suka shiga, inda ma\'ajiyar shafi ba za ta iya ba.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Shigar da Redis object-cache drop-in','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Yana buƙatar ƙarin phpredis. Idan babu shi, akwatin da ke sama da wannan allo zai nuna hakan.','Redis host'=>'Mai gida na Redis','Redis port'=>'Tashar Redis','Redis database'=>'Bayanan Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Ba kowace shafin da ke kan Redis da aka raba lambarta ta musamman ba, ko kuwa za su goge ma\'ajiyar juna.','Redis username'=>'Sunan mai amfani na Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Don kawai ga uwar garke ta Redis tare da masu amfani da ACL (Redis 6 ko daga baya). Bar shi babu komai don shiga da kalmar wata kaɗai.','Redis password'=>'Kalmar sirri ta Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Bar shi ba komai ba idan Redis ɗinka ba ya buƙatar ɗaya.','Key prefix'=>'Maɓallin prefix','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Madadin wani keɓaɓɓen lambar bayanan sirri lokacin da ba za ka iya samun ɗaya ba.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Tsaftacewa ta atomatik mai wayo','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Share abubuwan da abin ya shafa ta atomatik lokacin da abun ciki ya sauya','After updates'=>'Bayan sabuntawa','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Goge komai bayan sabunta tushe, filogin ko jigom-girma','After a comment'=>'Bayan sharhi','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Share shafin wallafa lokacin da aka amince da sharhi a kansa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Kashe wannan a kan sashen sharhi mai yawan aiki sosai, inda zai iya share shafi guda daruruwan sau a awa daya.','Never cache these'=>'Kar a taɓa adana waɗannan a ma\'ajiya','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Ana amfani da tsofaffin tsare-tsare masu ma\'ana na WordPress da WooCommerce a duk lokacin da aka yi – ba a taɓa yin caching ɗin karusar sayayya (cart), wurin biya (checkout), shafi na (my-account) da kowane zama (session) da aka shiga ba, komai abin da ke ƙasa.','Addresses'=>'Adireshi','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hanyar daya a kowane layi, misali <code>/basket</code>. Alamar <code>*</code> a ƙarshe tana dacewa da komai da ke ƙarƙashinta.','Query parameters'=>'Ma\'aunin bincike','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ba a taba yin ajiyar shafi mai dauke da daya daga cikin wadannan ba — alal misali alamar samfoti ta lokaci guda.','Cookies'=>'Kuki','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Ana ba wa baƙon da ke ɗauke da ɗayan waɗannan sabon shafi a kowane lokaci.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'An cire duk shafukan da aka adana a madadin (cache). Za a sake gina su yayin da masu ziyara suka isa.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'An adana abin lura a cikin cache, amma baya adana komai.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Ana amfani da madubin shafi (page cache), amma ba a ajiye shafukan yanzu ba tukuna.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress bai ĺoda madogaran adana shafin na page-cache ba tukuna. Yana farawa a lodi na gaba; idan bai yi haka ba, bincika ko WP_CACHE gaskiya ne a cikin wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'An adana abubuwa yana kunne, amma wannan sabar ba ta da goyon bayan Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ba a shigar da tsawo na phpredis ba, saboda haka ba za a iya amfani da drop-in ba kuma WordPress yana komawa zuwa ma\'ajiya ta cikinsa ta in-memory cache. Tambayi ma\'aikacin bakuncin yanar gizo naka don ya maida phpredis ya yi aiki.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Ba a ajiyewa a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi komai.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Duka cache biyu a kashe suke, don haka wannan plugin din baya sa shafin ya zama mai sauri ba.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ana amfani da caching a kan wannan shafin.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis ya ki amincewa da sunan mai amfani ko kalmar sirri. Duba bayanan shiga na Redis a cikin wp-config.php ko a kan wannan allo.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis ya karɓi shiga amma bai ba da izinin wannan shafin ya adana maɓallansa ba. Mai amfani da Redis na buƙatar izini don gaban maɓallin wannan shafin.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis ta ki amincewa da lambar bayanan. Duba saitunan bayanan Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis ya cika, ba shi da sauran wurin ajiya, kuma yana ƙin karɓar sabbin bayanai.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ba a sanya tsawo na phpredis ba, saboda haka WordPress na amfani da nata cache na cikin abin tunawa. Ka nemi mai masaukin yanar gizon ka ya kunna phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'An saita WP_REDIS_DISABLED a cikin wp-config.php, don haka an kashe ma\'ajiyar abu.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga sabar ta Redis ba. Duba mai masaukin baki da tashar jiragen ruwa na Redis, da kuma cewa Redis yana aiki.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis bai dawo da darajar da aka rubuta a ciki ba yanzu. Duba rajistar uwar garken Redis.','Web server'=>'Sabobin yanar gizo','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — gidan yanar gizo yana adana shafuka a cikin uwar garken yanar gizo','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'ba LiteSpeed ba — wannan plugin yana adana shafuka a kan disk','Pages stored on disk'=>'Shafukan da aka adana a kan disk','Redis support'=>'Goyon bayan Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'an shigar da phpredis','phpredis is not installed'=>'ba a shigar da phpredis ba','Page lifetime'=>'Lokacin shafin','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Ba ka da izinin tsaftace cache.','Cache purge requested.'=>'An nemi tsaftace cache.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: an shigar da wani rukunin raba abu na dabam, don haka wannan plugin din ba ya sarrafa maballin abu na Redis.','detected'=>'an gano','not detected'=>'ba a gano ba','phpredis extension missing'=>'tsawaita phpredis ta ɓace','installed, not storing anything'=>'an shigar, ba a adana komai ba','active, managed by your host'=>'mai aiki, wanda mai watsa shafinka ke sarrafawa','active'=>'mai aiki','inactive'=>'mara aiki','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Cache na LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Cache na abu na Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Tsawaita PHP na Redis (phpredis) ba ya samuwa a wannan sabar, don haka ba za a iya kunna cache na abu ba.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Wani matatse na adana abubuwa na musamman na abu (object-cache drop-in) an riga an shigar da shi. Cire shi kafin ka kunna Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil ɗin saitin haɗin Redis ba.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta drop-in na cache na abu da aka haɗa ba.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Ba a iya shigar da drop-in na cache na abu cikin wp-content ba.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Ba a iya cire drop-in na cache na abu ba.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Tsarin fayil na WordPress ba a iya rubuta shi, don haka ba a iya sarrafa drop-in na cache na abu ba.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Wani plugin na adana shafi ya shigar da wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Cire wannan plugin din tukuna, ko kuma ci gaba da amfani da ajiyar shafinsa.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil din wp-content/cache/zinn-cache ba, don haka ba za a iya adana shafuka a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi ba.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wp-content/advanced-cache.php ba, saboda haka ba za a iya adana shafuka a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi ba.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis din sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukarwa don wannan sabuntawar ba. Tabbatar cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya isa ga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya saukar da sabuntawar daga sabis na sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Gwada kuma bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta kasa wucewa binciken amincinta, don haka ba a girka ta ba.','Go Pro'=>'Je zuwa Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Allon nazarin cache: adadin nasara, ƙwaƙwalwa, maɓallai da umarnin cache mafi jinkiri.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Wani mai nemo sann-zuwa-sann da kuma kiran da ba a adana a cikin cache ba wanda ke sanya sunan plugin ko jigo mai alhakin hakan.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Tsarin APCu na in-memory a gaban Redis don hotuna masu zafi mafi amfani, tare da rigakafin zazzagewa, matsewa da abin igbinary serializer.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Sharewa ta hanyar tag don sako-sako, sharudda da samfuran WooCommerce, domin a share abin da kawai ya canza, tare da share ma\'ajiyar shafi da ta abu tare.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Ci gaban ɗumama ma\'ajiyar bayanai ta atomatik bayan sharewa, hotunan WebP da AVIF, cire CSS da ba a amfani da su da kuma jinkirta JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Ana tsara tsaftace bayanan tare da samfoti, da dokokin keji na kowane shafi.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Sanarwar lafiyar cache a cikin dashboard na Zinn Digital® lokacin da ragowar bugawa ta fadi ko kuma memory ya cika.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Komai a kan sauran shafuka kyauta ne kuma zai ci gaba da kasancewa kyauta. Pro yana shigarwa a saman wannan plugin ɗin kuma yana ƙara:','See what Pro costs'=>'Ga abin da Pro yake biya','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Kowane shiri yana farawa da gwaji kyauta na kwanaki 14, ba a buƙatar katin bashi ba: %1$s a shekara don shafi ɗaya, %2$s don shafuka biyar, %3$s don shafuka marasa iyaka.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'Ba a sami wp-config.php ba, saboda haka ba a iya kunna WP_CACHE ba. Ƙara define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); a ciki.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'An riga an bayyana WP_CACHE a matsayin false a cikin wp-config.php, don haka ba za a iya fara cache na shafin ba. Canza shi zuwa true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wa a cikin wp-config.php ba, saboda haka ba a iya kunna WP_CACHE ba. Ƙara define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); a ciki.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Buga sabon ƙima don maye gurbinsa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jerin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matattara.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layin da ke sama','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Bayani gaba ɗaya','Copied'=>'An kwafi','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane plugin na Zinn® a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanit don wannan plugin ɗin.','Open settings'=>'Buɗe saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sashen saituna','Support'=>'Tallafi','Save changes'=>'Ajiye sauye-sauye','Tools'=>'Kayayyaki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Mayar da su zuwa tsoffin kaya','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari na wannan plugin zuwa asalin sa. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsaloli na tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da kaya','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba su taɓa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamomi ko maɓallan API ba — za ka buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon shafin.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'An kafa dukkan saitunan da ke kan wannan fagin a matsayin na asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wancan matakin ba shi da samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Waccan fayil din yayi yawa sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wancan fayil ba fitar da saitin Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani plugin daban (%s), don haka shigo da shi nan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da waɗancan.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da waɗancan.','Connected'=>'Haɗe','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na bukatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Ana gudanarwa a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan "plugin" ɗin bai faɗi dalili ba. A tura rahoton bincike don mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan neini daidai abin da za a aika - babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu wani abin da aka boye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomin shiga da maɓallan API ba su ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Mun buɗe tikitin goyon baya don ku kuma mun ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ka fi son kada ka aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama kuma ka manna shi a cikin tikiti da kanka.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya lalace game da saitunanka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura rahoton ku zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn® kuma za su ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lambar tunani %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ka aika da rahotanni da yawa a cikin dan kankanin lokaci. Jira \'yan mintoci kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu ce, ba daga gare ku ba. Gwada sake yi ba da daɗewa ba, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Shin kana da liyafar ba da masauki? Sami %1$d%% rangwame a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayinka na abokin ciniki mai karɓar baƙi na Zinn Digital®, kana samun lambar sirri don samun rangwamen %d%% a kan biyan kuɗinka na farko. Sabuntawa suna kan farashin al\'ada.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Samu lambata ta %d%% sannan ka tafi wurin biya','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne masu tsarin daukar bakuncin gidan yanar gizo da aka biya kuma suke cikin kyakkyawan hali. Gwaje-gwaje kyauta ba su cancanta ba.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin ciniki na masaukin yanar gizo don wannan plugin din.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku a yanzu ba. Don Allah a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kadan.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gojin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa wanda aka gina domin mutanen da suke gudanar da fiye da shafi ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, yankunan yanar gizo da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da riƙe kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan don rayuwa','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.','Style preset'=>'Saitin salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Matsayin mafari. Duk abin da ke ƙasa zai ɓata shi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmangu nawa','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da tsarin kamar yadda yake.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'maɓallin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Har yanzu ba a haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda hakan ke da mahimmanci don hana kunnawa ba tare da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani na WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusun ajiyar','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusun ku sannan ku sake ƙaddamar da fom ɗin abokin tarayya.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna so ku haɗa %1$s cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunyar Kyauta ta Farko','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'kunna lasisi a nan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fat za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin da ka karɓa a cikin imel ɗin nan da nan bayan siyan:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunyar lasisi a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar da ake biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna ta don fara amfani da abubuwan %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar da ake biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je %2$s don kunna shi kuma a fara amfani da fa\'idodin %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunyar da fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An kunna asusun ku cikin nasara tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yanki daban','Add-Ons'=>'Abubuwan da za a iya ƙarawa','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ƙarin Abubuwa na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya loda jerin kari ba. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kaɗan.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙarin abu ne na musamman na biya kawai. Dole ne ka fara siyan lasisi kafin ka kunna plugin ɗin.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An nasarar sayen %s Add-on.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An ciyar da tsarin Add-on ɗin ka na %s zuwa babban mataki cikin nasara.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An cire %s kyauta cikin nasara. Tunda ƙarin yana da alaƙa ne kawai da tsarin biyan kuɗi, an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kana son amfani da shi a nan gaba, dole ne ka sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya gudanar da %s ba ba tare da fasalin ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai ina sanar da ku cewa ana dauko bayanan kari na %s daga wani sabar na waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki na na\'urar %s','Address'=>'Adiireshi','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshin %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin haɗin gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Saboda keta sharuddan haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusun haɗin gwiwarku na wani dan lokaci. Idan kuna da wata tambaya, da fatan za a tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusun abokin tarayyarka na wani ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi buƙatar ku ta zama abokin ciniki na %1$s! Shiga yankinku na abokan ciniki a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amince da roƙon ku a yanzu. Don Allah a sake gwadawa bayan kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntube ku da karin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s biyan gurbin sa ido bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Alaka','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisin ku ya ƙare, har yanzu za ku iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar amfani da fasalulluka na %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zaran lasisin ku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin ƙima.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Har yanzu kuna iya jin daɗ તમામ abubuwan da ke cikin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na %2$s ba, Haka ma tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da ingantawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan kyautarka ta %1$s, biya kaɗan kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yardika & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Canza Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Dukkan Bukatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'uka','allow'=>'ba da izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Ka riga ka yarda da shiga cikin tsarin bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin tsarin bibiyar amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadin','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kowace Shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin da ba a san wanda ya bayar ba','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Yi amfani da shi a kan duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Yi amfani da shi a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Yi amana don zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince & Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Don Allah ka gaya mana dalili domin mu inganta.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel da ka yi amfani da shi don haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake tura maka maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel din da ka yi amfani da shi yayin siyayya kuma za mu sake turo maka da lambar lasisin.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa da ainihin asusun mai lasisin.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'An ingantaccen ID na samfurin.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ka da ingantaccen lasisi don samun damar shiga sigar gaba da ɗaya.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigar da kaya ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka zabi shiga.','Premium version already active.'=>'An riga an kunna sigar Premium.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sabon fasalin kari na musamman.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin "Serviceware" ne wanda hakan ke nufin ba shi da sigar lambar kuɗi ta musamman.','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta Kanta','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa ta atomatik a cikin:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Matsayi','Awesome'=>'Mai kyau','based on %s'=>'dangane da %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadan mu kuma ku sami ɗan kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin sigar da ka shigar na %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi cikin kintatawa, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a shafukan samarwa. An gargabe ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An biya %s','Billing'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biyan Kuɗi & Lissafin Kuɗi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana kullewa','Blog ID'=>'Lambar Blog','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Eh - adireshin biyun nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Haɗe','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kamfani','Buy license'=>'Sayen lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka/ki da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon ma) - kana/kina son soke %2$s din ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai hana shiga cikin duk wasu abubuwa masu inganci nan take. Kana da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke rajistar','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun mabudin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canza lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An tura sakon imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne mai imel ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Na gode da tabbatar da canjin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canza Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canja Tsarin Aiki','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku canja wurin mallakar asusun ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Canjin tarihin abubuwa','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ka karɓi imel ɗin ba, ka gwada duba babban fayil ɗin da ba a buƙata ba ko kuma ka bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zaɓi har shafin / shafukan yanar gizo %s domin kunna lasisin.','City'=>'Birni','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ka\'idar API Cache','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Wankakken Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da plugin din ba tare da nuna suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna domin ganin sharhi da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'Adireshin imel na abokin cinikina shine %s','Code'=>'Lambar asiri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kaso %s lokacin da abokin ciniki ya siya sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka wuce kwanaki 30 kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'kammala rajista','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Karɓe kowane sabuntawa mai mahimmanci','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Na gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista domin karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress yanayin muhalli. Wannan zai taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma mafi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yi rajista don samun sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & siffofi, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci na musamman, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, ba komai! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki da kyau sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ku taɓa rasa muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ku taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙata ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna matukar farin ciki da gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin cibiyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin ko shafuka %s a cikin hanyar sadarwa waɗanda har yanzu ke buƙatar kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A yayin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin/shafukan yanar gizo %d da har yanzu suke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana son amfani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah shigar da madogaran lasisin ka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunna shi.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, zaka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya a shafin Account na matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s dinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar kun gama, kashe %s sannan ku sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓe mu','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kana son mu tuntube ka game da sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da tayi lokaci-lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Yi hakuri game da rashin jin dadi da aka samu kuma muna nan don taimaka muku idan kun ba mu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntube Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Don Allah tuntube mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Don Allah a tuntube mu da wannan sakon:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu ba da gudummawa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is n